    <string>Fitnofat uses the motion sensors to automatically count your reps during strength training exercises.</string>
    <key>NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription</key>
    <string>Fitnofat uses photos to let you share workout machine setups and exercise form with your AI coach.</string>
    <key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key>
    <string>Fitnofat uses the camera to take photos of exercise setups for your AI coach.</string>
    <key>UIViewControllerBasedStatusBarAppearance</key>
    <true/>
